<h1>Eclipse HX SNMP Manager</h1>

<p>Monitor and browse Clear-Com Eclipse HX matrices via SNMP.</p>

<div class="home-cards">
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>&#x2699; Configuration</h3>
        <p>Add and manage matrix IP addresses. Settings are saved to an XML configuration file.</p>
        <a href="configuration" class="btn">Go to Configuration</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>&#x1F333; MIB Browser</h3>
        <p>Connect to a matrix and browse its SNMP MIB tree with live values.</p>
        <a href="mib-browser" class="btn">Go to MIB Browser</a>
    </div>
</div>
